Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:06.25,TL,,0,0,0,,今年拿到{\fs78}4{\fs68}个单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.25,0:00:09.04,TL,,0,0,0,,四大满贯却都没进{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.04,0:00:11.18,TL,,0,0,0,,去年缺席年终的梅德韦德夫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:14.41,TL,,0,0,0,,是怎样把都灵门票赢回来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:18.27,TL,,0,0,0,,新赛季第一站 他就在布里斯班夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.27,0:00:20.49,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛两盘击败中岛布兰登
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.49,0:00:22.47,TL,,0,0,0,,冠军来得很早
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.61,0:00:40.19,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Finishes in style as 2026 starts in magical fashion for Daniil Medvedev.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N漂亮收官 {\fs78}2026{\fs68}梦幻开局！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.53,0:00:43.39,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He is the Brisbane International champion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他是布里斯班国际赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.07,0:00:46.64,TL,,0,0,0,,澳网却很快给了他一记重击
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.64,0:00:48.19,TL,,0,0,0,,第四轮对勒纳 钱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.19,0:00:51.25,TL,,0,0,0,,连丢{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘 第二盘还是{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.33,0:01:02.77,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Learner Tien. Learner has handed out a lesson.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N勒纳 钱 给对手上了一课
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.57,0:01:09.59,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's a breakout performance from a star on the rise.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N冉冉升起的新星 打出突破表现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.59,0:01:11.85,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}We've seen something special here.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我们见证了一场特别的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.24,0:01:13.38,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2{\fs68}月的迪拜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.38,0:01:16.08,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛对手格里克斯普尔赛前因伤退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.08,0:01:19.03,TL,,0,0,0,,他拿到本季第二座单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.48,0:01:20.57,TL,,0,0,0,,印第安维尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.57,0:01:22.89,TL,,0,0,0,,他在半决赛击败阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.89,0:01:24.77,TL,,0,0,0,,闯进大师赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.77,0:01:27.85,TL,,0,0,0,,两盘抢七 还是输给辛纳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.30,0:01:30.74,TL,,0,0,0,,红土赛季 低谷更深
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.74,0:01:33.09,TL,,0,0,0,,蒙特卡洛两盘{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.09,0:01:35.82,TL,,0,0,0,,到了法网 首轮打满{\fs78}5{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.82,0:01:37.56,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.56,0:01:40.47,TL,,0,0,0,,却连丢{\fs78}4{\fs68}局 输给沃尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.32,0:02:00.84,TL,,0,0,0,,温网第三轮 斯特鲁夫又挡住了他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.84,0:02:04.93,TL,,0,0,0,,两盘抢七告负 第三盘再输{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.37,0:02:07.54,TL,,0,0,0,,美网第四轮 面对蒂亚福
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.54,0:02:09.38,TL,,0,0,0,,再次连丢{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.38,0:02:10.77,TL,,0,0,0,,今年四站大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.77,0:02:13.17,TL,,0,0,0,,他没有一次打进{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.43,0:02:32.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Frances Tiafoe is in that New York state of mind once again.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N蒂亚福又一次找回了属于纽约的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.52,0:02:34.73,TL,,0,0,0,,转折出现在中国赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.73,0:02:37.59,TL,,0,0,0,,杭州决赛 两盘击败卢布列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.59,0:02:39.75,TL,,0,0,0,,拿到年度第三冠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.19,0:02:41.62,TL,,0,0,0,,但中网半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.62,0:02:43.92,TL,,0,0,0,,他在失分后把球打向看台
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.92,0:02:46.17,TL,,0,0,0,,击中观众 被判失格
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.17,0:02:48.71,TL,,0,0,0,,这也成了他今年的低点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.16,0:02:51.00,TL,,0,0,0,,上海打进{\fs78}4{\fs68}强之后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:52.71,TL,,0,0,0,,他来到阿拉木图
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.71,0:02:54.22,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛先丢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.22,0:02:56.66,TL,,0,0,0,,再以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}翻回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.66,0:02:58.86,TL,,0,0,0,,拿到赛季第四冠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.26,0:03:01.66,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Usually most players will be a little bit weaker, but...{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多数球员这一侧稍弱 不过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.16,0:03:18.94,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And for the first time in his career, Daniil Medvedev{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N梅德韦德夫职业生涯第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.94,0:03:22.58,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}successfully defends a title. 6-7, 6-1, 6-3.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N成功卫冕 {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.43,0:03:25.82,TL,,0,0,0,,他终于在同一站
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.82,0:03:28.52,TL,,0,0,0,,连续两年捧起冠军奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.52,0:03:30.32,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}25{\fs68}座单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.32,0:03:32.90,TL,,0,0,0,,这是他第一次成功卫冕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.35,0:03:36.53,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}30{\fs68}日 维也纳{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.53,0:03:38.24,TL,,0,0,0,,两盘击败马纳里诺
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.24,0:03:41.22,TL,,0,0,0,,梅德韦德夫终于锁定年终资格
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:49.84,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, that's missed.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 这球出界了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.46,0:03:54.78,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A patient performance.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N耐心十足的一场表现
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.20,0:04:00.76,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}His third semi-final appearance here in Vienna.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他第{\fs78}3{\fs68}次闯入维也纳半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.91,0:04:04.05,TL,,0,0,0,,第七次入围 隔了一届又回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.05,0:04:07.87,TL,,0,0,0,,这张门票 是一站一站累积回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.31,0:04:09.35,TL,,0,0,0,,巴黎第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.35,0:04:12.38,TL,,0,0,0,,他以{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}输给布塞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.38,0:04:13.80,TL,,0,0,0,,巴黎的征程结束
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:16.59,TL,,0,0,0,,接下来 目光转向都灵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:19.59,TL,,0,0,0,,他是{\fs78}2020{\fs68}年的年终冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.59,0:04:23.19,TL,,0,0,0,,到了都灵 你还看好梅德韦德夫吗？
